      "body": "## Fresh recurrence on PR #4165 (2026-08-29)\n\nAfter the prior conflict was resolved, PR #4165 was rebased to `2cb88d7cb`, GitHub reported `MERGEABLE`, and all 10 CI jobs passed. `main` later advanced to `a1db16c77`; the PR genuinely became `CONFLICTING` again. AO displayed the conflict in the sidebar but did not send a second merge-conflict nudge to the worker.\n\nThe live row still had `last_nudge_signature.seen[merge-conflict:<PR URL>] = \"conflicting\"` and attempt count 1, confirming the recurrence was suppressed by the durable signature.\n\n![PR card showing recurrent conflict](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Untrivial-ai/agent-orchestrator/issue-assets-recurrent-merge-conflict-nudge-20260829/.issue-assets/recurrent-merge-conflict-nudge-20260829/pr-card-conflict.png)\n\n![Activity showing exited conflict without a repeat worker notification](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Untrivial-ai/agent-orchestrator/issue-assets-recurrent-merge-conflict-nudge-20260829/.issue-assets/recurrent-merge-conflict-nudge-20260829/activity-exited-conflict.png)\n\nThe feature branch was rebased again to current `main` and force-pushed at `f0c65cc4f`; GitHub then returned to `MERGEABLE`. This is a second confirmed cycle of resolved \u2192 conflicting without a re-fired nudge.",
